mapping "M191B.1" source="M191B" target="699262001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source M191B SNOMED CT 699262001 = post-traumatic arthrosis, shoulder. Target SNOMED CT 44783205
        (699262001). Athena M19.11 (shoulder) crosswalk maps to 44783205 plus 40484571 (Disorder of
        joint of shoulder region). 44783205 captures the post-traumatic OA but without site specificity;
        the target subsumes the source across all sites, so this is broader. Moderate tier: SNOMED CT has
        no site-specific post-traumatic OA concept, so the mapping loses the shoulder site detail.
        """
}
